                  <provenance type="#e" source="1761"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_143">Cirencester,
                        Gloucestershire. Augustinian abbey of St Mary the Virgin</orgName><p>"Liber ecclesie sancte Marie de [Cyrence]st[r]'" (fol. iii
                        recto (erased, but mostly legible by u. v. light)), s. xiii
                        (?).</p><p>"Liber Magistri Aluredi" (fol. iii verso (s. xii ex. ?); cf.
                        Jesus Coll. 26 and Hereford Cathedral O.ii.4.</p><p>The traces of the erased
